    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/1a69a508c325ae3cec0990662859a2ae.avif?t=1750981133\" /></div><br><br>Alvo is a unique competitive FPS designed from the ground up for VR to provide some of the most thrilling and intense combat seen in the VR FPS genre. Trading ultra-realism for faster-paced gameplay, Alvo is a finely-tuned cocktail of mechanics that will keep you addicted and coming back round after round.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Free for all<br></li><li> Team Deathmatch<br></li><li> Hardpoint<br></li><li> Search and Destroy<br></li><li> Zombies</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/8575e86b5088c6e0525049de34068512.avif?t=1750981133\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessibility:</h2><br>Not all gamers want or have the same play-style, we understand this and try to accommodate for everyone. You can play Alvo sitting or standing, using manual reload or button reload, and choose the amount of in-game UI you want to see.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> In-game UI color theme<br></li><li> Weapon attachments<br></li><li> Weapon skins<br></li><li> Characters<br></li><li> Perks<br></li><li> Killstreaks </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/4d9b44ccf2e6dfdcfad543d66b8eaa50.avif?t=1750981133\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/1a69a508c325ae3cec0990662859a2ae.avif?t=1750981133\" /></div><br><br>Alvo is a unique competitive FPS designed from the ground up for VR to provide some of the most thrilling and intense combat seen in the VR FPS genre. Trading ultra-realism for faster-paced gameplay, Alvo is a finely-tuned cocktail of mechanics that will keep you addicted and coming back round after round.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Free for all<br></li><li> Team Deathmatch<br></li><li> Hardpoint<br></li><li> Search and Destroy<br></li><li> Zombies</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/8575e86b5088c6e0525049de34068512.avif?t=1750981133\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessibility:</h2><br>Not all gamers want or have the same play-style, we understand this and try to accommodate for everyone. You can play Alvo sitting or standing, using manual reload or button reload, and choose the amount of in-game UI you want to see.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> In-game UI color theme<br></li><li> Weapon attachments<br></li><li> Weapon skins<br></li><li> Characters<br></li><li> Perks<br></li><li> Killstreaks </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/4d9b44ccf2e6dfdcfad543d66b8eaa50.avif?t=1750981133\" /></div>",
